{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00836","headline":"郊庙歌辞 晋朝飨乐章 四举酒 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 晋朝飨乐章 四举酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八表欢无事，三秋贺有成。\n照临同日远，渥泽并云行。\n河变千年色，山呼万岁声。\n愿修封岱礼，方以称文明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}